{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/page,_N_T_/products/gamewall-240hz"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$c$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/19mx3mg6lkumu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2-rtuqsgzmno4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3i1tnniunbom4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>GameWall 240Hz LED Display | Ultra-Smooth Gaming Dubai | Brightluxx</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Elevate gaming with GameWall 240Hz LED display in Dubai. Ultra-smooth visuals from Brightluxx UAE. Request your demo today!\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-240hz\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"site-header\" data-testid=\"site-header-nav\"><div class=\"site-header__inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" data-testid=\"logo-link\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><button data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"GameWall 240Hz\", \"description\": \"GameWall is purpose-built for gamers who demand the largest, fastest display possible. 240Hz native refresh rate with under 3ms input lag delivers competitive-grade responsiveness on a massive LED canvas. VRR (Variable Refresh Rate) support for both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC eliminates tearing. Game-specific display modes for FPS, racing, and RPG genres. HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs support 4K@240Hz.\", \"sku\": \"BL-HC-GW240\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-240hz\", \"category\": \"home-cinema\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_gamewall-240hz.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 8000, \"highPrice\": 80000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-240hz\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the GameWall 240Hz ideal for competitive gaming?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall 240Hz features a native 240Hz refresh rate and under 3ms input lag, ensuring ultra-smooth visuals and minimal delay. This responsiveness is crucial for high-level competitive gameplay.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the available sizes for the GameWall 240Hz?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall 240Hz comes in three large sizes: 100\\\", 120\\\", and 150\\\", providing an expansive viewing area suitable for immersive gaming experiences and home cinemas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the GameWall handle variable refresh rate (VRR)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It supports both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC VRR technologies, effectively eliminating screen tearing and stuttering for fluid gameplay on compatible gaming PCs and consoles.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What inputs are available on this LED wall?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall 240Hz is equipped with HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs, supporting up to 4K resolution at 240Hz to meet modern gaming standards.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the GameWall 240Hz different from traditional gaming monitors or TVs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike conventional monitors, the GameWall offers a significantly larger LED canvas with superior brightness (1000 nits) and a pixel pitch of 1.5mm for sharp visuals. Its massive scale and professional gaming features create a truly immersive experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation complicated for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires professional handling due to the size and complexity of the LED panel. Our team can provide full installation services to ensure optimal setup and display calibration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty coverage comes with the GameWall 240Hz?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"We offer a comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance issues. Typical coverage includes parts and labor for a set term\\u2014specific warranty details can be provided upon inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which gaming environments are best suited for the GameWall 240Hz?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GameWall is perfect for gaming rooms, esports training facilities, sim racing setups, and VR lounges. Its size and performance enhance immersion and competitive responsiveness in these applications.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"GameWall 240Hz\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-240hz\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>GameWall 240Hz</h1><p>Elevate gaming with GameWall 240Hz LED display in Dubai. Ultra-smooth visuals from Brightluxx UAE. Request your demo today!</p><p><strong>240Hz LED wall built for competitive and immersive gaming.</strong></p><p>GameWall is purpose-built for gamers who demand the largest, fastest display possible. 240Hz native refresh rate with under 3ms input lag delivers competitive-grade responsiveness on a massive LED canvas. VRR (Variable Refresh Rate) support for both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC eliminates tearing. Game-specific display modes for FPS, racing, and RPG genres. HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs support 4K@240Hz.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the GameWall 240Hz ideal for competitive gaming?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz features a native 240Hz refresh rate and under 3ms input lag, ensuring ultra-smooth visuals and minimal delay. This responsiveness is crucial for high-level competitive gameplay.</p><h3>What are the available sizes for the GameWall 240Hz?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz comes in three large sizes: 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot;, providing an expansive viewing area suitable for immersive gaming experiences and home cinemas.</p><h3>How does the GameWall handle variable refresh rate (VRR)?</h3><p>It supports both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC VRR technologies, effectively eliminating screen tearing and stuttering for fluid gameplay on compatible gaming PCs and consoles.</p><h3>What inputs are available on this LED wall?</h3><p>The GameWall 240Hz is equipped with HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs, supporting up to 4K resolution at 240Hz to meet modern gaming standards.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a