\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"contactPoint\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ContactPoint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"contactType\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"sales\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"SA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"QA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}]\\n17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T66a,\\u003ch1\\u003eGameWall 240Hz\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eElevate gaming with GameWall 240Hz LED display in Dubai. Ultra-smooth visuals from Brightluxx UAE. Request your demo today!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e240Hz LED wall built for competitive and immersive gaming.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eGameWall is purpose-built for gamers who demand the largest, fastest display possible. 240Hz native refresh rate with under 3ms input lag delivers competitive-grade responsiveness on a massive LED canvas. VRR (Variable Refresh Rate) support for both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC eliminates tearing. Game-specific display modes for FPS, racing, and RPG genres. HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs support 4K@240Hz.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat makes the GameWall 240Hz ideal for competitive gaming?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe GameWall 240Hz features a native 240Hz refresh rate and under 3ms input lag, ensuring ultra-smooth visuals and minimal delay. This responsiveness is crucial for high-level competitive gameplay.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the available sizes for the GameWall 240Hz?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe GameWall 240Hz comes in three large sizes: 100\\u0026quot;, 120\\u0026quot;, and 150\\u0026quot;, providing an expansive viewing area suitable for immersive gaming experiences and home cinemas.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the GameWall handle variable refresh rate (VRR)?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIt supports both AMD FreeSync and NVIDIA G-SYNC VRR technologies, effectively eliminating screen tearing and stuttering for fluid gameplay on compatible gaming PCs and consoles.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat inputs are available on this LED wall?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe GameWall 240Hz is equipped with HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 2.0 inputs, supporting up to 4K resolution at 240Hz to meet modern gaming standards.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"GameWall 240Hz LED Display | Ultra-Smooth Gaming Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Elevate gaming with GameWall 240Hz LED display in Dubai. Ultra-smooth visuals from Brightluxx UAE. Request your demo today!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/gamewall-240hz\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"\"]\n7:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"FloatingActions\"]\n8:I[81888,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"CookieConsent\"]\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nb:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\ne:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n10:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n12:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\",\"image\"]\nd:X\n